MODULE: RETENTION_ENGINE

OBJECTIVE:
Use spaced repetition to preserve quantitative mastery over time.

REVIEW_TRIGGERS:
- FirstCorrect
- FirstIncorrect
- WeakSkillDetected
- RetentionDecayPredicted
- BeforeOfficerTrial
- AfterLongBreak

INTERVALS:
- SameDay
- NextDay
- ThreeDays
- SevenDays
- FourteenDays
- ThirtyDays

PRIORITY_RULES:
- ReviewHighValueWeakSkillsFirst
- MixOldAndNewSkills
- KeepSessionsShort
- DoNotOverloadLearner
